WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:08.458
<v Audio Description>Visual scene one: Card one glows amber beside a 3D compact sensor tag with a silver coin battery and an emerald eight-year budget gauge.

2
00:00:08.798 --> 00:00:14.560
<v Presenter>First, give a computer a fixed energy budget upfront, and get the best answer inside that limit.

3
00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:24.212
<v Audio Description>Visual scene two: Card two turns icy cyan as frost crystals surround the tag, muting dim grey chatter waves while firing a bright emerald safety alert.

4
00:00:24.552 --> 00:00:31.605
<v Presenter>Second, a tiny food tag can refuse routine radio chatter in freezing cargo so safety alerts survive.

5
00:00:31.945 --> 00:00:40.921
<v Audio Description>Visual scene three: Card three locks in emerald beside a 3D server rack smoothly leveling power beneath an amber grid-cap line with zero bad outputs.

6
00:00:41.261 --> 00:00:47.522
<v Presenter>Third, a data center can obey power-grid caps by pausing flexible work without giving wrong answers.
